{# Every router: containerlab's startup config adds a default route via the management bridge. The lab keeps Management0
   in the default VRF, so that route would carry client traffic onto the host once the service route is withdrawn.
   NAPALM and the collector reach the routers on the connected management subnet and do not need it. #}
no ip route 0.0.0.0/0 {{ mgmt.ipv4.split('.')[:3] | join('.') }}.1
